      "text": "Six of the athletes are students from ETH Zurich:\n\nLike the Olympic Games, the Universiade takes place in both summer and winter. The first Summer Universiade was organised in 1959 by the International University Sports Federation (FISU), with the first Winter Universiade following a year later."
